flowchart TD
  Start[Start: New game / Resume / Settings] --> Setup[Human count / character / personal goals]
  Setup --> Rival{One human?}
  Rival -->|Yes| Optional[Optional rival / target difficulty]
  Rival -->|No| Prepare[Ordered turn preparation]
  Optional --> Prepare
  Start -->|Resume| Restore[Load stable saved state]
  Restore --> Ready[Town or saved location]
  Prepare --> Win{Start-turn goal gates}
  Win -->|Complete| Finish[Place / Continue / New game / Exit]
  Win -->|Incomplete| Notices[Remaining preparation notices]
  Notices --> Ready
  Ready --> Travel[Select destination / travel]
  Travel --> Visit[Location / contextual actions]
  Visit --> Child[Job list / course / broker / pawn / newspaper]
  Child --> Visit
  Visit -->|Exit with time| Ready
  Visit -->|Exit exhausted| Next[Next eligible participant]
  Travel -->|Time exhausted| Next
  Next --> Prepare
  Finish -->|Continue others| Next
